# bnf of fd
@name    Row

Row      Comment | ^ Ind? Key Ws? Val

Ind      Ws | Ws? Indx Ws?
Indx     >++ | \d++>
Key      Qstring | Unqkey
Val      (?: Qstring | Number | Const )? Ws? $ | `` Length | Unqstr? Ws? $

Unqkey   \S++
Unqstr   [^\r\n]++
Const    true | false | null | \{\} | \[\]
Number   -?\d++(?:\.\d++)?(?:[Ee][+-]?\d++)?

Qstring  \\? (?: '(?:[^']++|'')*+' | "(?:[^"]++|"")*+" | `(?:[^`]++|``)*+` )

Length   x Hex{2} | X Hex{3} | xx Hex{4} | xX Hex{5} | X X Hex{6}
Hex      [\dA-Fa-f]{2}
Ws       [\t\x20]++
Comment  ^[\t\x20]*+\#[^\r\n]*+$
